<title>USA: Hayes Wheels receives contract from Fiat.</title>
<headline>Hayes Wheels receives contract from Fiat.</headline>
<dateline>ROMULUS, Mich. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hayes Wheels International Inc said Tuesday it received a contract from Fiat SpA to supply cast aluminum wheels for the Bravo GT passenger car, beginning with the 1997 model year.</p>
<p>The wheels are being produced at the company's manufacturing facility in Campiglione, Italy, for shipment to Fiat's assembly plant in Cassino, Italy. Shipment began in January.</p>
<p>In addition to the Bravo GT, Hayes Wheels said it currently supplies wheels for several other Fiat passenger cars, including the Punto, Croma and Alfa Romeo 145 and 146.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
